&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324" style="color: #fff; background: #e74c3c; padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); display: inline-block;"&gt;前往查看详情&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="简介"&gt;简介&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 id="章节列表"&gt;章节列表&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324/reader/1" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;系统设定&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324/reader/2" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第一章：试作：初获系统与第一次任务（二合一）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324/reader/3" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二章：坏了，系统成了夫妻二人的调和剂了&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324/reader/4" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三章：女神给我打电话，结果我听到了她的娇喘和呻吟，坏了，我成了舔狗了；不对，我本来就是舔狗&lt;del&gt;汪汪汪&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324/reader/5" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第四章：女神突然的示好？还有这好事&lt;/del&gt;（加更~）&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324/reader/6" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第五章：与女神关系越来越好了，好开心啊&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324/reader/7" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第六，七，八章：女神发来的晚餐邀约，舔狗也有春天；精心策划送娇妻，核心任务开启；夫目前犯与梅开二度&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324/reader/8" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第九章：分析与交心；彻底放开的叶梦和即将到来的&amp;hellip;..&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324/reader/9" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第十，十一章：我的女神娇妻终于和另一个男人确认了男女朋友关系，她一边和男朋友做爱还一边叫他老公！！！当我亲眼看到我的娇妻慢慢爱上了别人后&amp;hellip;.&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324/reader/10" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第🔟2️⃣章：听着曾经属于我的爱称现在属于了别的男人，属于的爱妻也在别的男人胯下，为什么感觉不到心痛呢？&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324/reader/11" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第🔟3️⃣章 当我的娇妻真正爱上了那个男人后，我才发现，如果没有系统，老婆可能真的就跟人跑了&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324/reader/12" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第🔟4️⃣章 没想到系统出了隐奸功能，但是，我能控制！可是我不知道的是，还有个录像功能！新技能登场~&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324/reader/13" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第🔟5️⃣章 终于，我的爱妻被肏怀孕了，无能的我只能默默接受，并祝福她！&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324/reader/14" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第🔟6️⃣章 老婆和奸夫回家见父母了；卧槽，天底下有这样的事情吗？还有天理吗，还有王法吗？&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/2efbc14319614b96b40623d951f38324/reader/15" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;完结章：系统之主诞生，进军宇宙&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>小姐姐大弟弟 [禁漫天堂]</title><link>https://aiacg.github.io/comics/2026/03/25/oc048o08w444wkwp/</link><pubDate>Wed, 25 Mar 2026 03:13:08 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://aiacg.github.io/comics/2026/03/25/oc048o08w444wkwp/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="本页为收录内容-点击下方按钮跳转查看内容详情"&gt;本页为收录内容 点击下方按钮跳转查看内容详情&lt;/h2&gt;
